#| `pref R(0; t, u, v)` for `t + u + v <= 8` into `S` at `(t D + u) D + v`, `D = 9`:
#| `herm_rfill(S, 8, al, X, Y, Z, F, pref)` without the loops. `F` holds `F_0 .. F_8`.
def mdg_r_8(S: Arr, al, X, Y, Z, F: Arr, pref) {
    m2a = -2.0 * al
    r0 = pref * F[0]
    w1 = pref * m2a
    r1 = w1 * F[1]
    w2 = w1 * m2a
    r2 = w2 * F[2]
    w3 = w2 * m2a
    r3 = w3 * F[3]
    w4 = w3 * m2a
    r4 = w4 * F[4]
    w5 = w4 * m2a
    r5 = w5 * F[5]
    w6 = w5 * m2a
    r6 = w6 * F[6]
